      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T05:51:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feels like it\u0027s going to be a lot of churn right before the release... Our dev process docs say we shouldn\u0027t do this pre-release and instead should do it post-release on master.\n\nI would love to have stable-3.11 back on jgit master, but I\u0027d rather have a solid 3.11.0 release if I had to pick between the two.",
